      ],
      "summary_en": "Causes the target to become drowsy, then fall asleep. While asleep, the target's Magic Resist is reduced. The first source of damage that breaks the sleep is doubled, up to a cap.",
      "summary_zh": "困倦使目标进入困倦状态，然后陷入昏睡。在昏睡状态下，目标的魔抗会被降低。打醒目标的第一个伤害来源会造成双倍伤害，但有封顶值。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
